{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, קְרָא","hw":"קְרָא","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קְרָא</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. call, read out, aloud (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, קָרָא\" href=\"/BDB,_קָרָא\", dir=\"rtl\">I. קרא</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִקְרֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">Dn 5:7</a>, 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶקְרֵא</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:17\" href=\"/Daniel.5.17\">17</a>; 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִקְרוֹן</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:15\" href=\"/Daniel.5.15\">15</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִקְרֵא</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:8\" href=\"/Daniel.5.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:16\" href=\"/Daniel.5.16\">16</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:4\" href=\"/Daniel.3.4\">3:4</a> +;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>call, proclaim</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהַיִל</span>: <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:4\" href=\"/Daniel.3.4\">Dn 3:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:11\" href=\"/Daniel.4.11\">4:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">5:7</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>read out, aloud</em>, acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּתָבָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">5:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:8\" href=\"/Daniel.5.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:15\" href=\"/Daniel.5.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:16\" href=\"/Daniel.5.16\">16</a>, v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:17\" href=\"/Daniel.5.17\">17</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> pers.). <strong>Peʿîl</strong> (W<sup>CG 225</sup>) Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֱרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:18\" href=\"/Ezra.4.18\">Ezr 4:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:23\" href=\"/Ezra.4.23\">23</a> <em>it was read</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קֳדָם</span> pers.<br><strong>Hithpe.</strong>  <em>be summoned,</em> Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְקְרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">Dn 5:12</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, קְרֵב","prev":"BDB Aramaic, קְצָת²"}